  "summary": "Space now toggles the spider between walking and paused. The change is in src/main.ts and typechecks; I haven't tried it in a browser. The animation clock only advances while walking, so pausing freezes the legs and body in their current pose and resuming continues from that pose with no jump. `window.__TASK_STATE__` is a `{ walking: boolean }` object, set to `true` at startup and updated on each Space press. I also call `preventDefault` on Space and ignore key auto-repeat, so holding the key doesn't flip the state repeatedly."
